WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.627
♪ ♪

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:03.504
You've taken the first step

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:06.173
towards gaining
control of your life.

00:00:06.215 --> 00:00:08.091
♪ ♪

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.010
At Hugs Not Thugs,

00:00:10.052 --> 00:00:12.346
we rehabilitate
ex-gang members.

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:14.056
JULIO: We offer free
legal counseling,

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:16.517
solar panel
installation classes.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:18.519
I even got dental insurance.

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:21.897
Man, your teeth still look
pretty (bleep) up, though.

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:24.316
Yeah, but guess what?

00:00:24.358 --> 00:00:25.734
They used to be
even more (bleep) up.

00:00:25.776 --> 00:00:28.195
♪ ♪

00:00:28.237 --> 00:00:30.489
My cousin spent the last
eight years in prison.

00:00:30.531 --> 00:00:31.365
Sorry I'm late!

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:32.407
I'm just trying to help him.

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:33.700
But that fool
won't listen to me.

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:35.536
Why does your body
still look 19,

00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:38.247
but your face looks 56, fool?

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:41.583
♪ ♪

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:44.920
No offense, my boy, but you
come off like a punk-ass bitch.

00:00:44.962 --> 00:00:47.214
-Do you mind moving your car?
-Bad timing.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:49.049
I think I got room.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:52.594
Studies show that the life
expectancy of a gangster,

00:00:52.636 --> 00:00:54.304
24 years old.

00:00:54.346 --> 00:00:56.390
But the life expectancy
of a punk-ass bitch?

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:57.641
(tires screech)

00:00:57.683 --> 00:00:58.851
76 years old.

00:00:58.892 --> 00:00:59.852
I'll just go around.

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:01.937
Ooh.

00:01:02.521 --> 00:01:05.566
♪ ♪

00:01:05.607 --> 00:01:07.276
-(crash)
-(horn honks)

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:09.111
-Thanks, fellas.
-(bell dings)

00:01:09.528 --> 00:01:11.947
People love buying cupcakes
from ex-gang members.

00:01:11.989 --> 00:01:15.993
Boy, oh, boy. These sure are
some yummy cupcakes.

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:17.744
Bitch, do you want me
to relapse?

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:19.288
Why don't you buy a cupcake?

00:01:19.872 --> 00:01:22.165
Thank you.
Red velvet is an amazing choice.

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:24.251
(doorbell rings)

00:01:24.293 --> 00:01:26.128
Want to help us go fight
some fools at the park?

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:28.422
I can't, dawg. My sciatic
nerve's been actin' up.

00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:30.716
-JULIO: Where's the problem?
-My L-4, L-5, dawg.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:33.886
-Damn, mine's L-5 and S-1.
-Come on, y'all stay focused.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:36.096
♪ ♪

00:01:36.138 --> 00:01:38.098
JULIO:Me and Maggie just
got back together again.

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:39.641
Who knows how long we're
gonna be together this time.

00:01:43.187 --> 00:01:46.064
♪ ♪

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:47.524
(high-pitched):
Get his ass.

00:01:47.566 --> 00:01:50.903
♪ ♪

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:53.405
I'd rather die than let you
fools walk all over me.

00:01:53.447 --> 00:01:56.658
-So just shoot me, please.
-Ooh, I'mma film this.

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.619
We don't even have guns.

00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:01.830
♪ ♪

